    Bug 1993070 - Account Hub Email: Add Manual Config option in the first step. r=tobyp


    **How to Test**
    - Open account hub
    - Enter in name and email
    - The manual config button should show up below the email address
    - Clicking it will send you to manual configuration

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D268228

